.SH "Node\&.js releases data"
.PP
All data is located in \fRdata\fP directory\&.

.PP
\fRdata/processed\fP contains \fRenvs\&.json\fP with node\&.js releases data preprocessed to be used by \fRBrowserslist\fP and other projects\&. Each version in this file contains only necessary info: version, release date, LTS flag/name, and security flag\&.

.PP
\fRdata/release-schedule\fP contains \fRrelease-schedule\&.json\fP with node\&.js releases date and end of life date\&.
.SH "Installation"
.PP
.PP
.nf
npm install node\-releases
.fi
.PP
 
